    <p class="eyebrow">Getting in touch</p>
    <h2>Four ways, and you pick the one you like</h2>
    <p class="lede">Some people want to call right now. Some would rather we call them. Some would rather text. And some do not want to do this on a screen at all. All four are fine.</p>

    <div class="cb">
      <h3>Start your family&rsquo;s file</h3>
      <p class="muted">Three things. That is the whole form. We call within one business day, and if we miss you we keep trying. On that call we take down where the family lived, what the work was, and the diagnosis. Then we go do the records hunt at no cost to you.</p>
      {% include "partials/lawmatics-callback.njk" %}
      <p class="legal">We use your number to call you about this and nothing else. We do not sell or share it. Ask us to delete it any time and we will.</p>
